# Project Constitution

## Principles

- Capture planning decisions close to the work.
- Tasks live in `bd`, not in `tasks.md`.

## Constraints

- Permissive defaults. Flip knobs in the frontmatter above to opt into ASDD
  enforcement (hooks, lint, preflight). See docs/design/asdd-whitepaper.md §10
  for the full key catalog.
